Package: cricket-client
Version: 0.0.1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6, libssl3, libelf1
Maintainer: Fivet Engineer <fivet.engineer@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/TF-Jordan/GPU_BAND_Sched
Description: Cricket GPU Remoting client library and wrapper
 Cricket is a virtualization layer for CUDA applications allowing remote
 execution of GPU kernels via ONC RPC. This package installs the client
 library (cricket-client.so) and a cricket-run wrapper that sets up
 LD_PRELOAD and REMOTE_GPU_ADDRESS automatically from
 /etc/cricket/client.conf.
 .
 No NVIDIA driver is required on the client machine.
